{"n": 737, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "737.webp", "text": "3037003\n\n37-6\n7s see CHECKING ROAD SPEED\n\nDEPENDENT ABSORBER\nSWITCHOVER\n\nConnect 35-pin universal adapter, simulator\nand BMW Service Tester (see “Checking EDC\nShock Absorbers with Shock Tester”).\n\nSet-simulator knob (D) to km/h,\n\nTurn back simulator regulator (E) to point\nshortly before stop,\n\nSat EDC selector switch to K,\n\nTurn on ignition (display control lamp K\ncomes on).\n\n‘Control unit operating voltage > 11.5 V.\n(measured between PIN 2 and PIN 11)\nTurn up simulator regulator (E), until solenoids\nswitch (loud click).\n\nNominal value: approx. 150 Hz (@ approx.\n110 km/h or 68 mph).\n\nTurn down simulator regulator (E) again\n\nuntil solenoids switch again.\n\nNominal value: approx. 135 Hz (= approx.\n710 km/h or 68 mph).\n\nRequirement: rio fault raport {absorber symbol\ncontrol lamp off),\n\nAlso refer to M 3 EDC Troubleshooting.\n\nNote:\n(Control lamps do not also switchover,", "words": [["3037003", 0.2053, 0.5265, 0.2543, 0.537], ["37-6", 0.4772, 0.0284, 0.5399, 0.0549], ["7s", 0.2725, 0.0708, 0.2978, 0.0813], ["see", 0.3049, 0.0787, 0.319, 0.0813], ["CHECKING", 0.3362, 0.0694, 0.3948, 0.0813], ["ROAD", 0.3999, 0.0694, 0.4328, 0.0813], ["SPEED", 0.4358, 0.0694, 0.4712, 0.0813], ["DEPENDENT", 0.3362, 0.0866, 0.405, 0.0992], ["ABSORBER", 0.408, 0.0866, 0.4702, 0.0992], ["SWITCHOVER", 0.3362, 0.1032, 0.411, 0.1151], ["Connect", 0.2705, 0.1336, 0.3124, 0.1548], ["35-pin", 0.3175, 0.1336, 0.3473, 0.1548], ["universal", 0.3514, 0.1336, 0.3948, 0.1548], ["adapter,", 0.3999, 0.1336, 0.4378, 0.1548], ["simulator", 0.4414, 0.1336, 0.4889, 0.1548], ["and", 0.2695, 0.1495, 0.2907, 0.17], ["BMW", 0.2968, 0.1495, 0.317, 0.17], ["Service", 0.3215, 0.1495, 0.3584, 0.17], ["Tester", 0.362, 0.1495, 0.3913, 0.17], ["(see", 0.3959, 0.1495, 0.4146, 0.17], ["“Checking", 0.4196, 0.1495, 0.4707, 0.17], ["EDC", 0.4767, 0.1495, 0.497, 0.17], ["Shock", 0.2695, 0.1667, 0.3018, 0.1878], ["Absorbers", 0.